msgstr "Roller"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:142
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tYou can limit the permissions granted to this token by choosing one or more\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tgroup of permissions below.<br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tLeave all the choices blank to grant all your permissions to this token.\n"
"\t\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tDu kan begränsa vilka privilegier denna token ger genom att välja en eller flera\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tgrupper av privilegier nedan.<br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tLämna alla alternativ omarkerade för att ge alla privilegier till denna token.\n"
"\t\t\t\t"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:158
msgid "Delete token"
msgstr "Radera token"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:162
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autentisering"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:164
msgid "Your API token"
msgstr "Din API-token"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:177
msgid "copy token"
msgstr "kopiera token"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:191
msgid "Download as a text file"
msgstr "Ladda ned som en textfil"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:194
msgid "How to use it"
msgstr "Hur du använder den"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:195
msgid "As a Bearer Token"
msgstr "Som Bearer-token"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:197
msgid "You can use this token by passing it as an <strong>Authorization: Bearer</strong> HTTP header."
msgstr "Du kan använda denna token genom att skicka den som en <strong>Authorization: Bearer</strong> HTTP-header."

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:200
msgid "HTTP Header"
msgstr "HTTP-header"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:213
msgid "copy HTTP header"
msgstr "kopiera HTTP-header"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:219
msgid "As a password"
msgstr "Som ett lösenord"

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:220
msgid "Alternatively, you can use this token as a password for HTTP Basic Authentication."
msgstr "Alternativt kan du använda denna token som ett lösenord för HTTP Basic Authentication."

#: internal/profile/x-tokens.templ:222
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tFor example, if an application only accepts a username and password, you can provide this token as a password.\n"
"\t\t\t\tThe username is ignored and can be anything, including an empty value.\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tTill exempel, om en applikation endast accepterar användarnamn och lösenord, kan du använda denna token som ett lösenord.\n"
"\t\t\t\tAnvändarnamnet ignoreras och kan vara vad som helst, inklusive ett tomt fält.\n"
"\t\t\t"

